eparately."},{"stringValue":"Gas top-up, which is its own service."},{"stringValue":"Dismantling a unit fitted into a false ceiling or a sealed box."},{"stringValue":"Commercial or industrial appliances."}]}},"faqs":{"arrayValue":{"values":[{"mapValue":{"fields":{"q":{"stringValue":"Does the price include spare parts?"},"a":{"stringValue":"No. ₹699 covers the visit and the visit. Any part the job needs is quoted on site, itemised with its labour, and nothing is ordered or fitted until you approve it."}}}},{"mapValue":{"fields":{"q":{"stringValue":"What if I do not want the extra work after the quote?"},"a":{"stringValue":"Then nothing happens beyond the visit. You pay the visit fee for the visit and the technician leaves — there is no pressure and no cancellation charge at that point."}}}},{"mapValue":{"fields":{"q":{"stringValue":"What if the same fault comes back?"},"a":{"stringValue":"Every completed job carries a 30-day service warranty on the work and the parts we supplied. While it is valid, a return visit for the same fault costs nothing."}}}},{"mapValue":{"fields":{"q":{"stringValue":"Who is coming to my home?"},"a":{"stringValue":"A technician on our own roster, not a marketplace of strangers. Their name, photo and rating are on the booking before they arrive, and they cannot start until you read out the code on that screen."}}}},{"mapValue":{"fields":{"q":{"stringValue":"How do I pay?"},"a":{"stringValue":"Card, UPI or netbanking through our payment provider, or after the service where that is offered. Every booking ends with a GST invoice you can download."}}}}]}},"createdAt":{"timestampValue":{"seconds":"1790232803","nanos":613000000}},"updatedAt":{"timestampValue":{"seconds":"1790232803","nanos":613000000}}},"createTime":{"seconds":"1790232804","nanos":296000},"updateTime":{"seconds":"1790232804","nanos":296000}}}228{"documentMetadata":{"name":"projects/demo-customerapp/databases/(default)/documents/catalogServices/air-conditioner_gas-refill","readTime":{"seconds":"1790232807","nanos":426958000},"exists":true,"queries":["catalogServices"]}}4089{"document":{"name":"projects/demo-customerapp/databases/(default)/documents/catalogServices/air-conditioner_gas-refill","fields":{"id":{"stringValue":"air-conditioner_gas-refill"},"applianceId":{"stringValue":"air-conditioner"},"serviceKey":{"stringValue":"gas-refill"},"name":{"stringValue":"AC Gas Refill"},"description":{"stringValue":"Leak test, repair of the leak point, vacuum and a full gas charge."},"visitFee":{"integerValue":"29900"},"startingPrice":{"integerValue":"219900"},"order":{"integerValue":"4"},"active":{"booleanValue":true},"video":{"stringValue":"/services/ac-gas-refill.mp4"},"poster":{"stringValue":"/services/ac-gas-refill.jpg"},"photo":{"stringValue":"/photos/air-conditioner/1.jpg"},"durationMinutes":{"integerValue":"105"},"rating":{"doubleValue":4.7},"reviewCount":{"integerValue":"880"},"reviewStats":{"mapValue":{"fields":{"count":{"integerValue":"13"},"sum":{"integerValue":"61"},"average":{"doubleValue":4.7}}}},"process":{"arrayValue":{"values":[{"mapValue":{"fields":{"title":{"stringValue":"Leak check"},"body":{"stringValue":"Gas does not run out on its own. The AC is pressure-checked first, because refilling a leaking system is money poured into the same hole."}}}},{"mapValue":{"fields":{"title":{"stringValue":"Quote"},"body":{"stringValue":"Whatever is needed beyond the visit is written up — part and labour separately — and nothing starts until you approve it."}}}},{"mapValue":{"fields":{"title":{"stringValue":"Refill"},"body":{"stringValue":"Charged to the manufacturer’s stated weight, measured, not guessed."}}}},{"mapValue":{"fields":{"title":{"stringValue":"Test and clean up"},"body":{"stringValue":"Cooling checked at the vent and the readings shown to you before we leave."}}}}]}},"excludes":{"arrayValue":{"values":[{"stringValue":"Spare parts. Anything needed is quoted on site and charged separately."},{"stringValue":"Any fault other than the one this visit was booked for, unless you approve it."},{"stringValue":"Repairing the leak itself, which is quoted separately once it is found."},{"stringValue":"Compressor replacement."},{"stringValue":"Commercial or industrial appliances."}]}},"faqs":{"arrayValue":{"values":[{"mapValue":{"fields":{"q":{"stringValue":"Does the price include spare parts?"},"a":{"stringValue":"No. ₹299 covers the visit and the leak check. Any part the job needs is quoted on site, itemised with its labour, and nothing is ordered or fitted until you approve it."}}}},{"mapValue":{"fields":{"q":{"stringValue":"Why check for a leak before refilling?"},"a":{"stringValue":"Because gas does not run out on its own. A AC that has lost its charge has lost it somewhere, and refilling without finding that is money poured into the same hole."}}}},{"mapValue":{"fields":{"q":{"stringValue":"What if I do not want the refill after the quote?"},"a":{"stringValue":"Then nothing happens beyond the visit. You pay the visit fee for the leak check and the technician leaves — there is no pressure and no cancellation charge at that point."}}}},{"mapValue":{"fields":{"q":{"stringValue":"What if the same fault comes back?"},"a":{"stringValue":"Every completed job carries a 30-day service warranty on the work and the parts we supplied. While it is valid, a return visit for the same fault costs nothing."}}}},{"mapValue":{"fields":{"q":{"stringValue":"Who is coming to my home?"},"a":{"stringValue":"A technician on our own roster, not a marketplace of strangers. Their name, photo and rating are on the booking before they arrive, and they cannot start until you read out the code on that screen."}}}},{"mapValue":{"fields":{"q":{"stringValue":"How do I pay?"},"a":{"stringValue":"Card, UPI or netbanking through our payment provider, or after the service where that is offered. Every booking ends with a GST invoice you can download."}}}}]}},"createdAt":{"timestampValue":{"seconds":"1790232803","nanos":613000000}},"updatedAt":{"timestampValue":{"seconds":"1790232803","nanos":613000000}}},"createTime":{"seconds":"1790232804","nanos":296000},"updateTime":{"seconds":"1790232804","nanos":296000}}}230{"documentMetadata":{"name":"projects/demo-customerapp/databases/(default)/documents/catalogServices/air-conditioner_installation","readTime":{"seconds":"1790232807","nanos":426958000},"exists":true,"queries":["catalogServices"]}}4141{"document":{"name":"projects/demo-customerapp/databases/(default)/documents/catalogServices/air-conditioner_installation","fields":{"id":{"stringValue":"air-conditioner_installation"},"applianceId":{"stringValue":"air-conditioner"},"serviceKey":{"stringValue":"installation"},"name":{"stringValue":"AC Installation"},"description":{"stringValue":"Indoor and outdoor mounting, piping, drain routing, vacuum and a cooling test."},"visitFee":{"integerValue":"149900"},"startingPrice":{"integerValue":"149900"},"order":{"integerValue":"5"},"active":{"booleanValue":true},"video":{"stringValue":"/services/ac-installation.mp4"},"poster":{"stringValue":"/services/ac-installation.jpg"},"photo":{"stringValue":"/photos/air-conditioner/2.jpg"},"durationMinutes":{"integerValue":"60"},"rating":{"doubleValue":4.8},"reviewCount":{"integerValue":"1270"},"reviewStats":{"mapValue":{"fields":{"count":{"integerValue":"10"},"sum":{"integerValue":"49"},"average":{"doubleValue":4.9}}}},"process":{"arrayValue":{"values":[{"mapValue":{"fields":{"title":{"stringValue":"Site check"},"body":{"stringValue":"The spot you want the AC in is checked first — power, water, drainage and clearance, whichever of them apply."}}}},{"mapValue":{"fields":{"title":{"stringValue":"Installation"},"body":{"stringValue":"Fitted, levelled and connected, with the fixings the job needs."}}}},{"mapValue":{"fields":{"title":{"stringValue":"Test run"},"body":{"stringValue":"The AC is started and watched through a full cycle, with you there."}}}},{"mapValue":{"fields":{"title":{"stringValue":"Clean up"},"body":{"stringValue